{"step_index":218,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T18:41:59Z","thinking":"**Deriving ballWithin Corollary**\n\nThe `mem_ballWithin_of_walk` result states any walk's endpoint is within a ball centered on its starting point, with a radius equal to the walk's length. Since the `ballWithin_subset_add` property holds, this implies the endpoint is also in any larger ball. This suggests proving a corollary extending the radius condition.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Add mem_ballWithin_of_walk_le and ballWithin_eq_univ_of_forall_walk","EndLine":242,"Instruction":"Append mem_ballWithin_of_walk_le and ballWithin_eq_univ_of_forall_walk","ReplacementContent":"lemma mem_ballWithin_of_walk {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] {v w : V} (p : G.Walk v w) :\n    w ∈ ballWithin G p.length v := by\n  induction p using SimpleGraph.Walk.concatRec with\n  | Hnil =>\n    dsimp [ballWithin]\n    exact Finset.mem_singleton_self _\n  | Hconcat p hadj ih =>\n    rw [SimpleGraph.Walk.length_concat]\n    dsimp [ballWithin]\n    rw [Finset.mem_union]\n    right\n    rw [Finset.mem_biUnion]\n    refine ⟨_, ih, ?_⟩\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter]\n    exact ⟨Finset.mem_univ _, hadj⟩\n\nlemma mem_ballWithin_of_walk_le {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] {v w : V} (p : G.Walk v w) {k : ℕ} (hk : p.length ≤ k) :\n    w ∈ ballWithin G k v := by\n  have hmem := mem_ballWithin_of_walk G p\n  obtain ⟨m, rfl⟩ := Nat.exists_eq_add_of_le hk\n  exact ballWithin_subset_add G p.length m v hmem\n\nlemma ballWithin_eq_univ_of_forall_walk {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (v : V) (k : ℕ)\n    (h : ∀ w : V, ∃ p : G.Walk v w, p.length ≤ k) :\n    ballWithin G k v = Finset.univ := by\n  ext w\n  simp only [Finset.mem_univ, true_iff]\n  obtain ⟨p, hp⟩ := h w\n  exact mem_ballWithin_of_walk_le G p hp\n","StartLine":223,"TargetContent":"lemma mem_ballWithin_of_walk {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] {v w : V} (p : G.Walk v w) :\n    w ∈ ballWithin G p.length v := by\n  induction p using SimpleGraph.Walk.concatRec with\n  | Hnil =>\n    dsimp [ballWithin]\n    exact Finset.mem_singleton_self _\n  | Hconcat p hadj ih =>\n    rw [SimpleGraph.Walk.length_concat]\n    dsimp [ballWithin]\n    rw [Finset.mem_union]\n    right\n    rw [Finset.mem_biUnion]\n    refine ⟨_, ih, ?_⟩\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter]\n    exact ⟨Finset.mem_univ _, hadj⟩","TargetFile":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/scratch.lean","toolAction":"Adding walk lemmas to scratch.lean","toolSummary":"Add walk lemmas"}}]}
