{"step_index":227,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T18:42:21Z","thinking":"**Proving the ballWithin theorem**\n\nThe goal is to prove `ballWithin G k v = Finset.univ`. The approach involves showing that every vertex `w` is within the ball. This is done by using the given hypothesis that there's a walk from `v` to any `w` with length at most `k`. Then, leverage that walk to establish that `w` is indeed in the ball.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Fix iff_true in ballWithin_eq_univ_of_forall_walk","EndLine":258,"Instruction":"Use iff_true in ballWithin_eq_univ_of_forall_walk","ReplacementContent":"lemma ballWithin_eq_univ_of_forall_walk {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (v : V) (k : ℕ)\n    (h : ∀ w : V, ∃ p : G.Walk v w, p.length ≤ k) :\n    ballWithin G k v = Finset.univ := by\n  ext w\n  simp only [Finset.mem_univ, iff_true]\n  obtain ⟨p, hp⟩ := h w\n  exact mem_ballWithin_of_walk_le G p hp","StartLine":246,"TargetContent":"lemma ballWithin_eq_univ_of_forall_walk {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (v : V) (k : ℕ)\n    (h : ∀ w : V, ∃ p : G.Walk v w, p.length ≤ k) :\n    ballWithin G k v = Finset.univ := by\n  ext w\n  simp only [Finset.mem_univ, true_iff]\n  obtain ⟨p, hp⟩ := h w\n  exact mem_ballWithin_of_walk_le G p hp","TargetFile":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9/scratch.lean","toolAction":"Fixing iff_true in scratch.lean","toolSummary":"Fix iff_true"}}]}
